THM-5134 (H)(iv): balanced states (auditor proof-5134-FH)
psi = h - q satisfies psi(2h) = psi(h) + h, psi(2h+1) = psi(h) + floor(h/2) + 1 for h < 2^23: True
closed sum for q agrees with the recursion (20000 random h < 2^24): True
q(h) < h/2, i.e. 2 psi(h) > h, for every 1 <= h < 2^24: True;  min of 2 psi(h) - h over 1 <= h < 2^24: 1
sup of q(h)/h over 1 <= h < 2^24: 0.499999970 at h = 16777215 = 0b111111111111111111111111  (below 1/2; the bound h/2 is not attained)

